sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Reg as Agent Registry
  participant Render as Config Renderer
  participant Drift as Drift Check
  participant Guard as Write Guard
  participant OS as OpenSpec
  participant Rev as Reviewer
  participant Agent
  Reg->>Render: render context, commands, tools, scope
  Render-->>Drift: generated agent config
  Drift->>Reg: compare hashes
  alt 配置漂移
    Drift-->>Agent: fail closed
  else 配置一致
    Agent->>Guard: write candidate artifact
    Guard->>Guard: path + scope + review receipt
    alt 无评审回执
      Guard-->>Agent: reject + audit
    else 有回执
      Guard->>OS: apply / validate
      OS-->>Rev: change boundary
      Rev-->>Agent: approved finding
    end
  end
  Note over Reg,Guard: 注册表是唯一配置源；受保护路径写入必须可追溯
